## Last-year order study (2025-09-08 .. 2026-09-08)

Cache: `Custom Label Database/docs/areeb-taxonomy-ss-skus.json` (complete). Statuses `shipped` + `awaiting_shipment`. **60,051** unique SKUs. **57,773** hit a CL row; **2,278** have no CL row (those SKUs are not in the catalog). Every CL row has Gender Apparel. CL classify source is `cl_standard` only.

Supply Method is a separate column (not Areeb). See `supply-method.mdc`.
